go 1.25.10

// Aether Go workspace.
//
// Service and shared-library modules are added here as they land.
//
// The go directive above is the floor — every module's go.mod must be
// at this version or higher, and the workspace tools (CI runners,
// CodeQL Action's setup-go step, etc.) must install at least this
// version. The matching pin in .github/workflows/{ci,codeql,release}.yml
// is `go-version: '1.25'`. Bumping this directive WITHOUT updating
// those workflows will break CodeQL extraction (was the cause of
// the November 2026 fix-codeql-pipeline PR).
//
// Why 1.25.10 specifically: it pulls in every reachable stdlib CVE
// fix that govulncheck flags against earlier 1.25.x patch
// releases — GO-2025-4007 (x509 name-constraint quadratic
// complexity, fixed 1.25.3), GO-2025-4011 (asn1 memory
// exhaustion, fixed 1.25.2), the 1.25.5 x509 batch, and the
// 1.25.8 net/url batch. The govulncheck CI job exits 0 only on
// 1.25.10+, so anything older breaks the pipeline.
//
// Why 1.25 family at all: pgx/v5 v5.9.2 (used by audit, smds,
// smdp-plus, eim for their Postgres backends) requires Go 1.25.

use (
	./pkg/asn1/sgp22/go
	./pkg/certmgrclient
	./pkg/crypto
	./pkg/hsmclient
	./services/audit
	./services/certmgr
	./services/eim
	./services/gateway
	./services/hsm-broker
	./services/profile-builder
	./services/smdp-plus
	./services/smds
	./test/e2e
	./tools/aether-verify-anchor
	./tools/conformance/runner
)
